Copyright (c) 2026 Zwaliebaba (github.com/Zwaliebaba).

**Species is an internal research project. It is not licensed for commercial
use, and it is not an open-source project.**

This file is a statement of the project's intended terms of use. It is not legal
advice, and — importantly — it is not a complete account of the rights covering
this repository. See "Provenance" below.

